k;endFill=1;strokeColor=#6B7280;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#6B7280;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;labelBorderColor=none;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c33" target="c35"><mxGeometry x="0.0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c51" value="Flows" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D1D5DB;strokeWidth=1.5;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1F2937;container=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1200" y="630" width="570" height="290" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c52" value="&lt;font color=&#x27;#0078D4&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp; Analysts → Static Web App: HTTPS, Entra sign-in (built-in auth)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#0078D4&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp; Static Web App → Function App /api/*: linked backend,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;signed-in principal forwarded by the platform&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#0078D4&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;3&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp; Agents → MCP /runtime/webhooks/mcp with an Entra bearer token,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;validated and role-checked on every tool call&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;4&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; Function App → PostgreSQL: TLS, Entra token as the password&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#0F766E&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;5&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp; Read: incident poller, advanced hunting, entity lookups&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#B91C1C&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;6&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp; Write: containment only after policy + human approval&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;7&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; Reference agent → Foundry Messages API with an Entra token&lt;br&gt;The Function App reaches storage and Application Insights with its&lt;br&gt;managed identity; no shared keys or connection secrets.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Agents hold &lt;b&gt;no&lt;/b&gt; Microsoft security permissions. No hop uses a stored secret." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2937;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1215" y="660" width="545" height="255" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c53" value="Azure icons © Microsoft, used unmodified under the Azure architecture icon terms. Microsoft Graph, Defender XDR and the Defender for Endpoint API have no Azure architecture icon, so they are drawn as plain cards." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=9;fontColor=#4B5563;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1140" width="1100" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>